  "description": "Welcome to Ark Survival Ascended Astraeo. In this video, we’ll cover over 30 of the best resource locations on Astraeos, ensuring you know exactly where to find metal, crystal, obsidian, oil, sulfur, rare flowers, rare mushrooms, black pearls, silica pearls, element dust, corrupted nodules, bio toxin, cementing paste, organic polymer, cactus sap, silk, leech blood, honey, plant species X seeds, sand, salt, electronics, and scrap metal.\n\nEach location offers a unique opportunity to gather high-value resources, including densely packed areas that are must-know spots for efficient farming.\n\nIf this video helped you, don’t forget to like, subscribe, and check out my other Ark guides—including my humorous take on taming the Meguana! \n\nAstraeos: Maeguana Taming: The Best $15 You’ll Ever Waste (Trust Me), Ark Survival Ascended\nhttps://youtu.be/a_hjiK1mm9s\n\n\nHere are the locations:\nIntro: 0:00-0:10\nLocation 1: 0:11-0:20\nLocation 2: 0:21-0:27\nLocation 3: 0:28-0:38\nLocation 4: 0:39-0:57\nLocation 5: 0:58-1:05\nLocation 6: 1:06-1:12\nLocation 7: 1:13-1:18\nLocation 8: 1:19-1:25\nLocation 9: 1:26-1:35\nLocation 10: 1:36-1:46\nLocation 11: 1:47-2:03\nLocation 12: 2:04-2:16\nLocation 13: 2:16-2:23\nLocation 14: 2:24-2:41\nLocation 15: 2:42-2:54\nLocation 16: 2:55-3:11\nLocation 17: 3:12-3:23\nLocation 18: 3:24-3:44\nLocation 19: 3:45-3:57\nLocation 20: 3:58-4:13\nLocation 21: 4:14-4:23\nLocation 22: 4:24-4:44\nLocation 23: 4:45-4:51\nLocation 24: 4:52-4:56\nLocation 25: 4:57-5:23\nLocation 26: 5:24-5:36\nLocation 27: 5:37-5:46\nLocation 28: 6:47-5:56\nLocation 29: 5:57-6:11\nLocation 30: 6:12-6:26\nLocation 31: 6:27-6:35\nLocation 32: 6:36-6:46\nLocation 33: 6:47-7:03\nLocation 34: 7:04-7:15\nMisc Resources: 7:16-8:28\n\n#arksurvivalascended #ark #arksurvival #arkastraeos",
